{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "65e74cc9-6bc2-825b-8612-e65ae9e76952",
  "created_at": "2026-02-09T12:49:55-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Finance",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "George Gifford",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Janet Whitcomb",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T12:46:53-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City of Newport Finance Department, this is Janet Whitcomb. How may I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T12:46:58-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi, good afternoon. Um, I got a parking ticket here and I'm not really sure what I'm supposed to do with it. It's for a hydrant."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T12:47:06-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. Do you have the ticket in front of you? I'll need the ticket number, which should be printed near the top."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T12:47:13-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I got it, hang on. [pause] Okay, it's got a, uh, bunch of numbers. Starts with a four, then seven, seven, one, and then, I can't tell if that's a zero or an O."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T12:47:23-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It will be a zero. Go ahead with the rest."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T12:47:27-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, zero, three, nine, two. That's the whole thing, I think. There's another number lower down but that looks like the, uh, the fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T12:47:35-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I have it. That ticket was issued for parking within the restricted distance of a fire hydrant. Is that the one you're calling about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T12:47:43-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, that's it. But here's the thing, it wasn't wicked close. I know where I parked. It was a good ways from that hydrant, way more than they're saying. I don't know how they figure it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T12:47:54-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. If you believe the ticket was issued in error, you have the right to contest it. That is done through a hearing rather than by paying the fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T12:48:03-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so wait. If I don't pay it, I go to a hearing? Or I have to pay first and then I go? I thought there was a form or something."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T12:48:12-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You would not pay first. You would request a hearing, and the ticket lists the instructions for doing so. Paying the fine is considered an admission, so you would only pay if you decide not to contest it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T12:48:23-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh. Okay. See, my wife usually makes these calls. She's the one who knows all this. But she's traveling right now, so it's me, and I'm kind of winging it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T12:48:32-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's quite all right, Mr. Gifford. I can walk you through it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T12:48:36-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Appreciate that. So, do you have a date for the hearing? Like when would I even go?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T12:48:42-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hearing dates are assigned once a request is received, so there isn't one on the ticket yet. Let me look at the record. [pause] I'm showing that no hearing has been scheduled for this ticket. Once you submit the request, you'll be notified of the date."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T12:48:55-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So I gotta ask for it first, and then they tell me the date. Not the other way around."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T12:49:01-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's correct. The request has to come first, and the notice follows."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T12:49:05-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And how long do I got to ask? Because the ticket's been sitting on my dashboard a few days."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T12:49:11-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There is a deadline printed on the ticket. Look on the back, under the section about contesting a violation. It should state the number of days from the issue date."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T12:49:20-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me flip it. [pause] Okay, yeah, there's a bunch of small print back here. I see it. I'll read it over. I still don't totally get the part about the form, though."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T12:49:30-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "If the instructions are unclear once you've read them, call us back and we'll go through each step. Could I also take your number in case we need to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T12:49:39-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, it's four-oh-one, five five five, oh one seven five."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T12:49:43-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Mr. Gifford. Four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-seven-five. Anything else today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T12:49:47-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, I think that's it. Thanks for your help. I'll try and figure out the rest."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-09T12:49:52-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good afternoon."
    }
  ],
